OL,3,GNEWSAGreen light for SEND reform in
OL,4,ADoncaster
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has given the green
OL,7,Flight to transform support for young
OL,8,Fpeople with special educational needs
OL,9,Fand disabilities (SEND) in Doncaster.
OL,11,FAs part of the reform, Doncaster
OL,12,FCouncil said it would work towards
OL,13,Fproviding "better support, earlier and
OL,14,Fcloser to home", which would include
OL,15,Fstrengthening support in mainstream
OL,16,Fschools and increasing the number of
OL,17,Fspecialist places.
OL,19,FThe news comes as part of wider SEND
OL,20,Freform across England, announced by the
OL,21,Fgovernment earlier this year, in
OL,22,Fresponse to rising demand for support.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
